  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">請將任何錯誤回報至問題頁面或留言區！</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#00f\">這是一個 Forge 模組</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>語言：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">-<span style=\"font-size:14px\"> <strong>繁體中文、西班牙文，以及使用 Google 翻譯的簡體中文</strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>- 如果您發現錯誤並能協助翻譯，我們將不勝感激！</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>功能特色：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">全新的附魔等級！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; - 大多數原版附魔擁有更高的等級</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; - 最高可達 10 級</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp;冰霜行者、深海漫步、經驗修復、精准采集、詛咒、多重射擊、火焰、無限、引雷以及水下速掘保持原有等級</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">防護附魔在滿級時最多可抵擋 98% 的傷害</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">新增攻擊距離屬性</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>紅色附魔必須透過與附魔師村民交易取得</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>目前附魔：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>護甲：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">淬鍊護甲&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;最高等級：5&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;適用：護甲&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;與加固護甲及重裝護甲不相容&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;增加 0.5 護甲堅韌度</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">加固護甲&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;最高等級：5&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;適用：護甲&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;與淬鍊護甲及重裝護甲不相容&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;增加 1 點護甲值（半件胸甲）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">生命提升&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;最高等級：5&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;適用：護甲&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;每級增加半顆心</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">飛行&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></strong>最高等級：3&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;適用：靴子&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;與靈魂疾行不相容&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;允許飛行，但會損壞靴子並產生飢餓感，等級越高持續時間越長</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">重裝護甲&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;最高等級：5&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;適用：護甲&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;與淬鍊護甲及加固護甲不相容&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;每級提供 0.5 擊退抗性</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">貓眼視覺&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;最高等級：1&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;適用：頭盔&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;讓您在黑暗中也能看見</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">踏步輔助&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></strong> &nbsp;最高等級：3 適用：靴子&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;每級可讓您多踏上 0.5 個方塊</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">現在有許多效果附魔可以應用於護甲。這些效果無法疊加，僅會生效等級最高的附魔！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>工具：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">自動複種&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;最高等級：1&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;適用：鋤頭&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;自動重新種植農作物</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">雙倍挖掘&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;最高等級：5&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;適用：工具&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;每級有 20% 機率額外破壞 1 個方塊</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">方塊距離&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;最高等級：10&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;適用：工具&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;與攻擊距離不相容&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;可讓您破壞更遠處的方塊</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>武器：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">攻擊距離</span></strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;最高等級：10&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;適用：武器&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;與方塊距離不相容&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;可讓您從更遠處攻擊敵人</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#000\">凍傷&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;最高等級：10&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;適用：武器&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;與橫掃之刃及暴擊不相容&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;每級凍結敵人 15 刻（0.75 秒）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">暴擊&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></strong>最高等級：5&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;適用：Weapo</span>ns&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;與橫掃之刃和凍傷不相容&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;每級有 20% 機率在暴擊時造成額外傷害或觸發暴擊</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">凍傷附魔帶有特殊的粒子效果</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>可附魔方塊：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">全新可應用於方塊的附魔已登場！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">只能透過附魔書獲得</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">快速傳輸&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;最高等級：1&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;適用：漏斗&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">提升傳輸速度</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">擴容儲藏&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;最高等級：1&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;適用：箱子、盒子與陷阱箱</span><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">為盒子、箱子與陷阱箱各增加一排儲存空間</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">迷彩&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;最高等級：1&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;適用：陷阱箱&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使陷阱箱外觀看起來像普通箱子&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可與擴容儲藏合併，獲得帶有額外儲存空間的迷彩陷阱箱</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">快速熔煉&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 最高等級：5&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;適用：熔爐、煙燻爐與高爐&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 加速熔煉/烹飪。等級越高熔爐越快。<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">省燃料&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 最高等級：5&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;適用：熔爐、煙燻爐與高爐&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 延長燃料使用時間。等級越高燃料持續越久。<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">額外經驗&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 最高等級：5&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;適用：熔爐、煙燻爐與高爐&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 從熔爐、煙燻爐或高爐收取物品時，您將獲得更多經驗。等級越高獲得的經驗越多<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>附魔師村民：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">交易高等級附魔書</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">工作方塊為附魔台</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">也會交易書架與經驗瓶</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">達到大師級時，有機會用綠寶石與隨機數量金塊（8 至 24 個）交換附魔金蘋果</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>設定：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- 啟用/停用模組自訂附魔</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- 關閉此功能並將最高等級設為 0，即可停用附魔台與 /enchant 指令的附魔功能</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- 啟用/停用原版附魔的變更</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- 設定附魔最高等級</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- 啟用/停用附魔師村民（注意：您必須重新啟動遊戲/伺服器才能使設定生效）</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- 村民仍會保留其職業，但不會有任何交易</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- 單人世界使用設定選單。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- 在專用伺服器上，請使用世界資料夾內的伺服器設定檔</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- 設定選單位於主畫面「模組」頁籤中的「So Many Enchants」頁籤，接著選擇「設定」</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- <strong>若要編輯設定，請前往您的世界儲存資料夾（或伺服器世界資料夾），進入 serverconfig 資料夾，然後開啟並修改 so_many_enchants-server.toml 檔案。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
